# Rust dependency licenses

This file contains the license and copyright texts for Rust crates in the
locked AutoPierCam workspace's normal dependency graph for
`x86_64-pc-windows-msvc`. Build-only, development-only, and non-Windows target
dependencies are excluded by `about.toml`.

The report is generated by `cargo-about 0.9.1`; do not edit it by hand.
Regeneration instructions are in `README.md` in this directory.

Regain camera drivers are built without modifications from
https://github.com/pulsarfab/regain/tree/98302af3c1c80bf64f670dc3ab70fb1851d1d062.
The unmodified MPL-2.0 `serialport 4.10.1` source is available at
https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/serialport/4.10.1/download and may be used under
MPL-2.0 (https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/). Its upstream license notice is
reproduced below; its archive checksum is pinned in Cargo.lock.

